  "description": "Kubernetes API server traffic, latency, admission, flow control, and storage. Custom dashboard (the Kubernetes project publishes none); metric families verified against kubernetes v1.37.1 sources: apiserver_request_total, apiserver_request_duration_seconds, apiserver_current_inflight_requests (staging/src/k8s.io/apiserver/pkg/endpoints/metrics/metrics.go), apiserver_admission_webhook_admission_duration_seconds (pkg/admission/metrics), apiserver_flowcontrol_rejected_requests_total (pkg/util/flowcontrol/metrics), etcd_request_duration_seconds and apiserver_resource_objects (pkg/storage/etcd3/metrics), plus the standard process_/go_ collectors. Scraped by the kube-apiserver ServiceMonitor (apps/kube-control-plane), scoped to namespace=\"default\".",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
